WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.667
-Welcome to the "Tonight Show,"
everybody.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:03.968
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching --

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:08.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
-- at home.

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:10.200
Well guys, this afternoon,
President Biden

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.234
held a press conference to
mark his first year in office.

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:15.434
And this was smart.

00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:17.767
To make Biden look good,
they had the CDC Director

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:22.701
go out first and open for him.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.033
"Boo, yeah! okay."

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:27.534
The press conference kicked off
at 4:00 p.m.

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:28.901
You can tell it was really
important for Biden,

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:30.868
because that's right in
the middle of dinner.

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:35.234
4:00 is when
I put my jammies on.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.167
Yeah, it was his first formal
press conference

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:39.534
at the White House since
March of last year.

00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:42.300
In Biden's defense, that one
just wrapped up a few days ago.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:45.901
"I had an old friend named
three-toed Larry."

00:00:45.901 --> 00:00:50.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:52.901
"He had a big toe, a middle toe,
and another big toe."

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:54.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.334
In his speech, Biden says that
we're in a better place

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:58.567
with COVID than
we've been before.

00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:00.734
Then a reporter sneezed
and everyone hit the floor.

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:03.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.334 --> 00:01:06.400
Biden also said, "Should we have
done more testing earlier?

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.501
Yes, but we're doing more now."

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:12.534
And he spent the next hour
asking himself questions until

00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:14.734
the press conference was over.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.834
"Is the economy rebounding?
Yeah.

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:19.267
Did I see the new Spider-Man?
No.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:22.067
Do I like superhero movies?
Yeah."

00:01:22.067 --> 00:01:23.367
But here's some good news.

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:26.467
Madame Tussauds just unveiled
their new figure

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:29.200
of President Biden.
Take a look at this.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:30.634
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:30.634 --> 00:01:33.667
Weirdly enough, that wax statue
has a 60% approval rating.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:35.968
-Really?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:38.701
-Some more news, I saw that the
January 6th committee

00:01:38.701 --> 00:01:41.334
just issued subpoenas
to a few more of Trump's

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:45.267
former associates, including
his old lawyer, Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:45.267 --> 00:01:46.868
You could tell Rudy is not a
very good lawyer,

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:48.467
because the first thing he
did he was google,

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:51.200
"What is a subpoena?"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.000
Rudy said he'd only comply if
his lawyer was present.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.767
Then he put a sock over his hand
and said,

00:01:55.767 --> 00:02:00.667
"I'm Mr. Giuliani's counsel."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:02.934
Meanwhile, if you google
Giuliani's subpoena,

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:04.467
they show you a clip from
the "Borat" movie.

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:08.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:11.234
-Come on.
-Some TV news.

00:02:11.234 --> 00:02:13.501
PBS just announced that
"Arthur,"

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:15.801
the longest-running animated
kids show in history,

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:18.234
will end next month
with a four --

00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:21.534
[ Audience "aws" ]
with a four-part finale

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:25.000
that shows the characters as
grown-ups.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.868
Yeah, aardvarks only live about
20 years,

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:29.334
so this could get kind of heavy.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:31.667
Here's Arthur as a kid.

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:32.801
Yeah.

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:34.934
And here he is as grown-Up.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:37.334
Yeah, it's interesting.
So this is going to be cute.

00:02:37.334 --> 00:02:44.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:45.801 --> 00:02:48.367
Well listen to this,
the CEO of Airbnb said that

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:51.567
he's going to permanently live
in Airbnb properties

00:02:51.567 --> 00:02:54.567
and move to a new one
every two weeks.

00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:57.501
Yeah. The CEO of motel 6 heard
this idea and was like,

00:02:57.501 --> 00:03:01.234
"Do not expect that from me."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.234 --> 00:03:04.200
And finally, I read that Peloton
is reportedly considering

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:07.334
scaling back
and closing some stores.

00:03:07.334 --> 00:03:09.367
We're three weeks into January,
I didn't expect my bike

00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:10.467
to be the one giving up.

